  "vendor_website": "imeitaly.com",
  "description": "Three-phase multifunction meter (72x72) with RS485 Modbus RTU: voltages, currents, powers, power factor, frequency, THD, energies, demand, crest factors and phase angles",
  "revision": 3,
  "revised": "2026-11-13",
  "source": "IME, Communication Modbus protocol PR141, MF724 Nemo 72Le, rev. B (20/10/2016, software 1.04), section 4.0 Variables",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Communication Modbus protocol MF724 NEMO 72Le (PR141)",
      "version": "Rev. B, 20/10/2016",
      "url": "https://assets.legrand.com/pim/DOCUMENT/PR141FR.pdf",
      "note": "section 4.0, variables from 0x100 to 0x1736; the harmonics (0x7000) and setup parameters (0x2000) are not in this map"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "IME Nemo 72Le (MF724). Variables of section 4.0 of protocol PR141.",
    "Addresses are the hex addresses of the protocol. Read with function 03; 32-bit values are MSW first (the meter can be set to swap words).",
    "Voltages are in mV and currents in mA (scale 0.001 here). The powers marked as depending on KTA x KTV are W, var or VA / 100 when KTA x KTV < 5000 and W, var or VA otherwise. The energies of 0x101C to 0x1022 and 0x1250 to 0x125E depend on KTA x KTV too: below 10 the unit is 10 Wh (varh), below 100 it is 100 Wh, below 1000 1 kWh, below 10000 10 kWh, from 10000 100 kWh. The blocks from 0x1500 and 0x1700 have fixed units (Wh, MWh, W, var).",
    "The device identifier (0x300 and 0x1204) reads 0x05.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
